OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786538913
OL,3,CCrews 'managing to contain' major fire
OL,4,Cafter working 'tirelessly' overnight
OL,6,FFirefighters are "managing to contain"
OL,7,Fa major fire in the New Forest after
OL,8,Fworking "tirelessly" through the night.
OL,10,FCrews from Hampshire Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService and neighbouring services have
OL,12,Fbeen battling the blaze since Sunday.
OL,14,FThe fire began on the eastbound
OL,15,Fcarriageway of the A31 - the main
OL,16,Froute through the New Forest - after a
OL,17,Fvan caught fire, before spreading to
OL,18,Fnearby heathland in a easterly
OL,19,Fdirection towards Backley Bottom.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
