OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786538913
OL,3,CCrews 'managing to contain' major fire
OL,4,Cafter working 'tirelessly' overnight
OL,6,FNational Highways has said the road
OL,7,Fwill remain closed in both directions
OL,8,Funtil the fire has been brought under
OL,9,Fcontrol and its teams are able to
OL,10,Frepair "significant" damage to the
OL,11,Froad surface, safety barriers and
OL,12,Fboundary fencing
OL,14,FAn update shared by the fire service
OL,15,Fon Tuesday morning said a change in
OL,16,Fwind direction had "provided a
OL,17,Fchallenge" overnight, but it was
OL,18,Fmanaging to prevent "spread and
OL,19,Fescalation" with the help of a police
OL,20,Fdrone to prioritise hotspots and flare-
OL,21,Fups.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786538913
OL,3,CCrews 'managing to contain' major fire
OL,4,Cafter working 'tirelessly' overnight
OL,6,FA total of seven fire engines with
OL,7,Fwater carriers and off-road vehicles
OL,8,Fwere involved in the operation
OL,9,Fovernight, which continued to use
OL,10,Fwater being pumped through miles of
OL,11,Fpipes laid from a nearby lake as part
OL,12,Fof a high volume pump (HVP) system.
OL,14,FThe fire service said in a statement:
OL,15,F"Overnight we had a slightly reduced
OL,16,Fpresence with seven fire engines on
OL,17,Fsite plus water carriers, off road
OL,18,Fvehicles and support vehicles but are
OL,19,Fplanning to increase this for a larger
OL,20,Fscale attack today.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786538913
OL,3,CCrews 'managing to contain' major fire
OL,4,Cafter working 'tirelessly' overnight
OL,6,F"We are maintaining water supply to
OL,7,Fthe site through combination of water
OL,8,Fcarriers and the High Volume Pump
OL,9,Fsystem.
OL,11,F"We recognise that the hoses that have
OL,12,Fbeen laid as part of this system do in
OL,13,Fplaces go across access to homes in
OL,14,Fthe area and we thank residents for
OL,15,Ftheir support and patience.
OL,17,F"The HVP allows us to move large
OL,18,Famounts of water over a longer
OL,19,Fdistance, helping crews maintain a
OL,20,Fcontinuous supply while they work to
OL,21,Fbring the fire under control."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786538913
OL,3,CCrews 'managing to contain' major fire
OL,4,Cafter working 'tirelessly' overnight
OL,6,FGillie Molland, lead ranger for the
OL,7,FNew Forest National Park Authority,
OL,8,Fsaid the affected area included
OL,9,Fprotected lowland heathland, which is
OL,10,Fhome to "many nationally and
OL,11,Finternationally rare species -
OL,12,Fincluding all six of the UK's
OL,13,Freptiles, insects, plants and birds
OL,14,Fsuch as Dartford warblers and
OL,15,Fnightjar".
OL,17,FShe said: "Some rare heathland species
OL,18,Fmay be lost or recover very slowly if
OL,19,Flocal populations have been affected."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786538913
OL,3,CCrews 'managing to contain' major fire
OL,4,Cafter working 'tirelessly' overnight
OL,6,FForestry England said it would be
OL,7,F"carefully assessing the impact" of
OL,8,Fthe fire after it was extinguished.
OL,10,FIt's also looked to reassure members
OL,11,Fof the public concerned about the
OL,12,Fsafety of wild ponies that graze on
OL,13,Fthe New Forest.
OL,15,F"All of these animals are owned and
OL,16,Flooked after by Commoners who are
OL,17,Fbeing kept informed regarding the
OL,18,Fincident," a spokesperson said.
OL,20,F"The animals can roam freely across
OL,21,Fthe Forest to unaffected areas."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786538913
OL,3,CCrews 'managing to contain' major fire
OL,4,Cafter working 'tirelessly' overnight
OL,6,FA Hampshire Constabulary spokeswoman
OL,7,Fsaid 23 vehicles were left behind by
OL,8,Fmotorists on Sunday, which were moved
OL,9,Fby police, with the owners asked to
OL,10,Fcall 101 to be reunited with their
OL,11,Fvehicles.
OL,13,FBournemouth Water, which supplies
OL,14,FRingwood and the New Forest, has asked
OL,15,Fresidents to reduce water usage as the
OL,16,Fneed for fighting the fire has added
OL,17,Fto the pressure put on supplies in the
OL,18,Farea because of the summer's heatwaves.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
